{
  "id": "26830_taihosuru",
  "headword": "{逮捕|たいほ}する",
  "reading": "たいほする",
  "romaji": "taihosuru",
  "part_of_speech": "suru verb",
  "gloss": "to arrest; to apprehend",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to arrest; to apprehend",
      "explanation": "To take a person into custody by legal authority. Used when police or authorities detain a suspect. Very common in news reports."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "26830_taihosuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{容疑者|ようぎしゃ}を{逮捕|たいほ}する。",
      "english": "To arrest the suspect.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "26830_taihosuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{警察|けいさつ}は{犯人|はんにん}をその{場|ば}で{逮捕|たいほ}した。",
      "english": "The police arrested the culprit on the spot.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "26830_taihosuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{詐欺|さぎ}の{疑|うたが}いで{男|おとこ}が{逮捕|たいほ}された。",
      "english": "A man was arrested on suspicion of fraud.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "26830_taihosuru_ex4",
      "japanese": "{飲酒|いんしゅ}{運転|うんてん}で{逮捕|たいほ}されると、{免許|めんきょ}が{取|と}り{消|け}しになる。",
      "english": "If you are arrested for drunk driving, your license will be revoked.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Extremely common in news broadcasts and newspaper articles. The passive form {逮捕|たいほ}される (to be arrested) appears more frequently than the active form in news reporting.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {現行犯|げんこうはん}{逮捕|たいほ}: caught in the act\n- {緊急|きんきゅう}{逮捕|たいほ}: emergency arrest\n- {逮捕|たいほ}{状|じょう}: arrest warrant\n- {逮捕|たいほ}{容疑|ようぎ}: charges at arrest\n- {不当|ふとう}{逮捕|たいほ}: wrongful arrest\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {捕|つか}まえる: to catch — general catching, not necessarily by authorities\n- {検挙|けんきょ}する: to apprehend — police term focusing on detection and arrest\n- {拘束|こうそく}する: to detain — broader term for restricting someone's freedom",
